{"seq":4,"slug":"code-review-practices","title":"Code Review 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/collaboration/code-review-practices","wordCount":884,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"code-review-实践\">Code Review 实践</h1><h2 id=\"code-review-的价值\">Code Review 的价值</h2><p><strong>Code Review（代码审查）</strong> 是软件工程中最有效的质量保障手段之一。Google 的工程实践表明，Code Review 不仅能发现缺陷，更重要的是促进知识共享和代码一致性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>价值维度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缺陷发现</td>\n<td>在合并前发现逻辑错误和边界情况</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>知识共享</td>\n<td>团队成员了解代码库的各个部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码一致性</td>\n<td>确保风格和架构模式的统一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导师作用</td>\n<td>资深成员指导新成员的成长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档效果</td>\n<td>PR 描述和讨论成为变更的永久记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Code Review 的目标是把变更的质量、身份与可追溯性同时纳入流程：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>审查清单</td>\n<td>结构化的检查维度，保证审查一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Conventional Commits</td>\n<td>结构化提交消息，驱动 CHANGELOG/版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提交签名</td>\n<td>用 GPG/SSH 证明提交的真实作者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分支保护</td>\n<td>强制审查与检查通过才能合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CODEOWNERS</td>\n<td>按路径自动指定审查者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>凭证管理</td>\n<td>安全存放 Git 认证信息的方式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"review-checklist\">Review Checklist</h2><p>结构化的检查清单能确保审查的全面性和一致性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查维度</th>\n<th>检查项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正确性</td>\n<td>逻辑是否正确，边界条件是否处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全性</td>\n<td>是否有注入、泄露风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>是否有 N+1 查询、不必要的循环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可读性</td>\n<td>命名是否清晰，结构是否合理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试</td>\n<td>是否有充分的测试覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档</td>\n<td>公共 API 是否有文档说明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向后兼容</td>\n<td>是否破坏了已有接口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# .github/pull_request_template.md&#10;## Review Checklist&#10;- [ ] 代码逻辑正确，边界条件已处理&#10;- [ ] 无安全风险（注入、泄露）&#10;- [ ] 性能可接受&#10;- [ ] 测试充分&#10;- [ ] 命名清晰，可读性好\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/pull_request_template.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">## Review Checklist</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 代码逻辑正确，边界条件已处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 无安全风险（注入、泄露）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 性能可接受</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 测试充分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 命名清晰，可读性好</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"conventional-commits\">Conventional Commits</h2><p><strong>Conventional Commits（约定式提交）</strong> 为提交消息定义了结构化格式，便于自动化生成 CHANGELOG 和语义化版本号：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"&lt;type&gt;(&lt;scope&gt;): &lt;description&gt;&#10;&#10;[optional body]&#10;&#10;[optional footer(s)]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">scope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[optional body]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[optional footer(s)]</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>版本影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>feat</td>\n<td>新功能</td>\n<td>minor 版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fix</td>\n<td>Bug 修复</td>\n<td>patch 版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>docs</td>\n<td>文档变更</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>style</td>\n<td>代码风格</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>refactor</td>\n<td>重构</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>perf</td>\n<td>性能优化</td>\n<td>patch 版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>test</td>\n<td>测试相关</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>chore</td>\n<td>构建/工具变更</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ci</td>\n<td>CI 配置变更</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git commit -m &quot;feat(auth): add OAuth2 login support&quot;&#10;git commit -m &quot;fix(parser): handle empty input gracefully&quot;&#10;git commit -m &quot;docs(readme): update installation guide&quot;&#10;&#10;# Breaking Change&#10;git commit -m &quot;feat(api)!: change response format to JSON:API&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"feat(auth): add OAuth2 login support\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"fix(parser): handle empty input gracefully\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"docs(readme): update installation guide\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Breaking Change</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"feat(api)!: change response format to JSON:API\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>强制执行 Conventional Commits：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使用 commitlint&#10;npm install --save-dev @commitlint/cli @commitlint/config-conventional&#10;&#10;# commitlint.config.js&#10;# module.exports = { extends: [&#39;@commitlint/config-conventional&#39;] };&#10;&#10;# 配合 Husky pre-commit hook&#10;npx husky add .husky/commit-msg &#39;npx --no -- commitlint --edit &quot;$1&quot;&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 commitlint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --save-dev</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @commitlint/cli</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @commitlint/config-conventional</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># commitlint.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># module.exports = { extends: ['@commitlint/config-conventional'] };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 配合 Husky pre-commit hook</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> husky</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .husky/commit-msg</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'npx --no -- commitlint --edit \"$1\"'</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"提交签名\">提交签名</h2><p><strong>签名提交（Signed Commits）</strong> 使用 GPG 或 SSH 密钥证明提交确实由声称的作者创建：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"gpg --full-generate-key&#10;gpg --list-secret-keys --keyid-format=long&#10;&#10;git config --global user.signingkey &lt;KEY_ID&gt;&#10;git config --global commit.gpgsign true&#10;&#10;git commit -S -m &quot;feat: signed commit&quot;&#10;git log --show-signature\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gpg</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --full-generate-key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gpg</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --list-secret-keys</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --keyid-format=long</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> user.signingkey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">KEY_I</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">D</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit.gpgsign</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -S</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"feat: signed commit\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --show-signature</span></span></code></pre></div><p>SSH 签名（Git 2.34+）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git config --global gpg.format ssh&#10;git config --global user.signingkey ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub&#10;git config --global commit.gpgsign true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gpg.format</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ssh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> user.signingkey</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit.gpgsign</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>签名方式</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GPG</td>\n<td>标准方案，广泛支持</td>\n<td>密钥管理较复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSH</td>\n<td>简单，复用已有 SSH 密钥</td>\n<td>需要 Git 2.34+</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[开发者] --&gt;|签名| B[Commit]&#10;    B --&gt;|push| C[GitHub]&#10;    C --&gt;|验证| D{Verified ✅}\">graph LR\n    A[开发者] --&gt;|签名| B[Commit]\n    B --&gt;|push| C[GitHub]\n    C --&gt;|验证| D{Verified ✅}</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> GitHub 和 GitLab 都支持在 commit 旁显示 &quot;Verified&quot; 标记。在安全敏感项目中，建议强制要求所有提交必须签名。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"review-工作流规范\">Review 工作流规范</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[作者提交 PR] --&gt; B[自动分配 Reviewer]&#10;    B --&gt; C[CI 检查]&#10;    C --&gt;|失败| D[作者修复]&#10;    D --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt;|通过| E[Reviewer 审查]&#10;    E --&gt;|Request Changes| F[作者修改]&#10;    F --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt;|Approve| G[合并]\">graph TD\n    A[作者提交 PR] --&gt; B[自动分配 Reviewer]\n    B --&gt; C[CI 检查]\n    C --&gt;|失败| D[作者修复]\n    D --&gt; C\n    C --&gt;|通过| E[Reviewer 审查]\n    E --&gt;|Request Changes| F[作者修改]\n    F --&gt; E\n    E --&gt;|Approve| G[合并]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规范</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Reviewer 数量</td>\n<td>至少 1 人，关键代码 2 人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应时间</td>\n<td>24 小时内开始审查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反馈方式</td>\n<td>建设性反馈，区分&quot;必须修改&quot;和&quot;建议&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审查范围</td>\n<td>每次不超过 400 行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动分配</td>\n<td>使用 CODEOWNERS 自动分配审查者</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# .github/CODEOWNERS&#10;*                @team-leads&#10;/src/auth/       @security-team&#10;/src/payment/    @payment-team&#10;/docs/           @docs-team\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/CODEOWNERS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                @team-leads</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">/src/auth/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">       @security-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">/src/payment/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    @payment-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">/docs/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">           @docs-team</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"credential-管理\">Credential 管理</h2><p>安全地管理 Git 凭证：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git config --global credential.helper osxkeychain&#10;&#10;git config --global credential.helper store&#10;&#10;git config --global credential.helper cache --timeout=3600&#10;&#10;gh auth login\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> credential.helper</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> osxkeychain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> credential.helper</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> store</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> credential.helper</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cache</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --timeout=3600</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> auth</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>安全性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SSH Key</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>推荐方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PAT + Keychain</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>macOS/Windows 系统凭证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>credential.store</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>明文存储，不推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gh CLI</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>GitHub 官方 CLI 认证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Code Review))&#10;    审查流程&#10;      Checklist&#10;      自动分配&#10;      24h 响应&#10;    Conventional Commits&#10;      feat / fix / docs&#10;      Breaking Change&#10;      commitlint&#10;    签名&#10;      GPG / SSH&#10;      Verified 标记&#10;      commit.gpgsign&#10;    凭证管理&#10;      SSH Key&#10;      Keychain&#10;      gh CLI\">mindmap\n  root((Code Review))\n    审查流程\n      Checklist\n      自动分配\n      24h 响应\n    Conventional Commits\n      feat / fix / docs\n      Breaking Change\n      commitlint\n    签名\n      GPG / SSH\n      Verified 标记\n      commit.gpgsign\n    凭证管理\n      SSH Key\n      Keychain\n      gh CLI</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Code Review</strong> 是质量保障和知识共享的核心实践，结构化 Checklist 确保审查全面性</li>\n<li><strong>Conventional Commits</strong> 标准化提交消息，支持自动生成 CHANGELOG 和语义化版本</li>\n<li><strong>GPG/SSH 签名</strong>验证提交身份，在安全敏感项目中应强制启用</li>\n<li>Review 规范应明确 <strong>Reviewer 数量、响应时间和反馈方式</strong></li>\n<li>使用 SSH Key 或系统凭证管理器安全地管理 Git 认证信息</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Code Review 实践","id":"code-review-实践"},{"level":2,"text":"Code Review 的价值","id":"code-review-的价值"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Review Checklist","id":"review-checklist"},{"level":2,"text":"Conventional Commits","id":"conventional-commits"},{"level":2,"text":"提交签名","id":"提交签名"},{"level":2,"text":"Review 工作流规范","id":"review-工作流规范"},{"level":2,"text":"Credential 管理","id":"credential-管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"冲突解决策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/collaboration/conflict-resolution"},"next":{"title":"子模块与子树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/monorepo-and-scale/submodules-and-subtrees"}}